<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan lowers dlr, mark interest rates.</title>
<headline>Pakistan lowers dlr, mark interest rates.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan cut July interest rates on five-year foreign currency bearer certificates denominated in dollars and marks, but left rates on yen and sterling certificates unchanged.</p>
<p> Currency	     July 1-31	    June 1-30</p>
<p> U.S. dollar	  8.75		   9.00 pct/year</p>
<p> Pound sterling     9.50		   9.50</p>
<p> Deutsche mark	7.00		   7.25</p>
<p> Japanese yen	 4.25		   4.25</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
